msgstr "Jika sambungan gagal, sahkan bahawa pentadbir akaun IBM Quantum Platform anda telah memberikan akses kepada SQOA Solver untuk instans perkhidmatan yang dipilih.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understand the SQOA framework {#understand-the-sqoa-framework}"
msgstr "Fahami rangka kerja SQOA {#understand-the-sqoa-framework}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Sampling-based Quantum Optimization Algorithm with Quantum Relaxation (SQOA-QR) [\\[2\\]](#references) combines Quantum Random Access Optimization (QRAO) with sample-based quantum diagonalization:\n"
msgstr "Algoritma Pengoptimuman Kuantum Berasaskan Pensampelan dengan Pelonggaran Kuantum (SQOA-QR) [\\[2\\]](#references) menggabungkan Quantum Random Access Optimization (QRAO) dengan pepenjuruan kuantum berasaskan sampel:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Quantum relaxation and encoding:** SQOA Solver converts the QUBO to a minimization Ising objective of the form $c + \\sum_i h_i z_i + \\sum_{i<j} J_{ij} z_i z_j$, where $z_i \\in \\{-1, +1\\}$. QRAO [\\[3\\]](#references) then maps each spin variable to a Pauli observable. For the $(3,1)$-QRAC encoding used here, the relaxed Hamiltonian is\n"
msgstr "**Pelonggaran dan pengekodan kuantum:** SQOA Solver menukar QUBO kepada objektif Ising peminimuman dalam bentuk $c + \\sum_i h_i z_i + \\sum_{i<j} J_{ij} z_i z_j$, dengan $z_i \\in \\{-1, +1\\}$. QRAO [\\[3\\]](#references) kemudian memetakan setiap pemboleh ubah spin kepada observabel Pauli. Untuk pengekodan $(3,1)$-QRAC yang digunakan di sini, Hamiltonian yang dilonggarkan ialah\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\widetilde{H} = cI + \\sum_i \\sqrt{k_i} h_i P_{f(i)} + \\sum_{i<j} \\sqrt{k_i k_j} J_{ij} P_{f(i)} P_{f(j)},\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\widetilde{H} = cI + \\sum_i \\sqrt{k_i} h_i P_{f(i)} + \\sum_{i<j} \\sqrt{k_i k_j} J_{ij} P_{f(i)} P_{f(j)},\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   where $I$ is the identity operator, $f(i)$ assigns variable $i$ to a qubit and one of $X$, $Y$, or $Z$, and $k_i \\in \\{1,2,3\\}$ is the number of variables mapped to the same qubit as $i$. When both relevant qubits contain three variables, the linear and quadratic scaling factors become $\\sqrt{3}$ and $3$, respectively.\n"
msgstr "   dengan $I$ ialah operator identiti, $f(i)$ menetapkan pemboleh ubah $i$ kepada satu qubit dan salah satu daripada $X$, $Y$, atau $Z$, dan $k_i \\in \\{1,2,3\\}$ ialah bilangan pemboleh ubah yang dipetakan pada qubit yang sama dengan $i$. Apabila kedua-dua qubit yang berkaitan mengandungi tiga pemboleh ubah, faktor penskalaan linear dan kuadratik masing-masing menjadi $\\sqrt{3}$ dan $3$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   Variables that share a qubit are assigned different noncommuting Pauli observables. Variables that interact in the QUBO are kept on different qubits, while variables with no direct QUBO interaction can share a qubit. The reduction in qubit count therefore depends on the structure of the problem.\n"
"2. **Quantum sampling:** A quantum processor samples bitstrings from circuits designed to explore low-energy states of the relaxed Hamiltonian.\n"
"3. **Sample-based diagonalization:** The solver projects the relaxed Hamiltonian onto the subspace spanned by basis states obtained from the sampled bitstrings and diagonalizes the projected Hamiltonian classically [\\[4\\]](#references), [\\[5\\]](#references). For a fixed set of sampled bitstrings, let $\\mathcal{S}_r$ be the subspace spanned by $r$ distinct basis states, so $\\dim(\\mathcal{S}_r) \\leq r$. Its estimated ground-state energy is:\n"
msgstr ""
"   Pemboleh ubah yang berkongsi satu qubit ditetapkan observabel Pauli tidak kalis tukar tertib yang berbeza. Pemboleh ubah yang berinteraksi dalam QUBO disimpan pada qubit yang berbeza, manakala pemboleh ubah tanpa interaksi QUBO langsung boleh berkongsi satu qubit. Oleh itu, pengurangan bilangan qubit bergantung pada struktur masalah.\n"
"2. **Pensampelan kuantum:** Pemproses kuantum mensampel rentetan bit daripada litar yang direka untuk meneroka keadaan bertenaga rendah bagi Hamiltonian yang dilonggarkan.\n"
"3. **Pepenjuruan berasaskan sampel:** Penyelesai memproyeksikan Hamiltonian yang dilonggarkan ke atas subruang yang direntangi oleh keadaan asas yang diperoleh daripada rentetan bit yang disampel dan memepenjuruankan Hamiltonian terunjur secara klasik [\\[4\\]](#references), [\\[5\\]](#references). Bagi set tetap rentetan bit yang disampel, biarkan $\\mathcal{S}_r$ ialah subruang yang direntangi oleh $r$ keadaan asas yang berbeza, jadi $\\dim(\\mathcal{S}_r) \\leq r$. Anggaran tenaga keadaan asasnya ialah:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   E_r = \\min_{\\substack{|\\psi\\rangle \\in \\mathcal{S}_r \\\\ \\langle\\psi|\\psi\\rangle=1}} \\langle\\psi|\\widetilde{H}|\\psi\\rangle, \\qquad \\mathcal{S}_r \\subseteq \\mathcal{S}_{r'} \\Longrightarrow E_{\\mathrm{exact}} \\leq E_{r'} \\leq E_r \\quad (r' \\geq r),\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   E_r = \\min_{\\substack{|\\psi\\rangle \\in \\mathcal{S}_r \\\\ \\langle\\psi|\\psi\\rangle=1}} \\langle\\psi|\\widetilde{H}|\\psi\\rangle, \\qquad \\mathcal{S}_r \\subseteq \\mathcal{S}_{r'} \\Longrightarrow E_{\\mathrm{exact}} \\leq E_{r'} \\leq E_r \\quad (r' \\geq r),\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   where $E_{\\mathrm{exact}}$ is the ground-state energy of the full relaxed Hamiltonian. Therefore, a larger retained subspace cannot increase the estimated ground-state energy.\n"
msgstr "   dengan $E_{\\mathrm{exact}}$ ialah tenaga keadaan asas bagi Hamiltonian terlonggar yang penuh. Oleh itu, subruang terkekal yang lebih besar tidak boleh meningkatkan anggaran tenaga keadaan asas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   This ordering assumes the same sampling result and concerns the relaxed-Hamiltonian energy before rounding. It does not theoretically guarantee a better returned classical solution. However, in QRAO, a lower-energy state is heuristically expected to provide a better classical solution.\n"
"4. **Rounding:** The relaxed state obtained from the diagonalization is converted into a classical binary assignment.\n"
msgstr ""
"   Susunan ini mengandaikan hasil pensampelan yang sama dan berkenaan tenaga Hamiltonian terlonggar sebelum pembundaran. Ia tidak menjamin secara teori penyelesaian klasik yang dikembalikan lebih baik. Walau bagaimanapun, dalam QRAO, keadaan bertenaga lebih rendah dijangka secara heuristik memberikan penyelesaian klasik yang lebih baik.\n"
"4. **Pembundaran:** Keadaan terlonggar yang diperoleh daripada pepenjuruan ditukar kepada penetapan binari klasik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver surrounds this framework with classical processing. Before the quantum mapping, presolve applies reduction rules that can fix variables and simplify the remaining QUBO while preserving at least one optimal solution. After the diagonalization and rounding, a classical local search refines the assignment, and OMMX reconstructs and evaluates the complete solution.\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver mengelilingi rangka kerja ini dengan pemprosesan klasik. Sebelum pemetaan kuantum, presolve menerapkan peraturan pengurangan yang boleh menetapkan pemboleh ubah dan memudahkan QUBO yang tinggal sambil mengekalkan sekurang-kurangnya satu penyelesaian optimum. Selepas pepenjuruan dan pembundaran, carian setempat klasik memperhalus penetapan, dan OMMX membina semula serta menilai penyelesaian lengkap.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Load the instance {#load-the-instance}"
msgstr "Muatkan instans {#load-the-instance}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "QOBLIB distributes each MIS instance as a graph in the DIMACS `.gph` format, a line-based format in which the line starting with `p` gives the numbers of nodes and edges and each line starting with `e` defines an edge.\n"
msgstr "QOBLIB mengedarkan setiap instans MIS sebagai graf dalam format DIMACS `.gph`, iaitu format berasaskan baris yang baris bermula dengan `p` memberikan bilangan nod dan tepi, dan setiap baris bermula dengan `e` mentakrifkan satu tepi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "QOBLIB also publishes an optimal or best-known reference solution for each instance. The following functions download both from the QOBLIB repository. DIMACS labels nodes starting from 1, so the graph is relabeled to start from 0.\n"
msgstr "QOBLIB juga menerbitkan penyelesaian rujukan optimum atau terbaik yang diketahui bagi setiap instans. Fungsi berikut memuat turun kedua-duanya daripada repositori QOBLIB. DIMACS melabelkan nod bermula dari 1, jadi graf dilabel semula supaya bermula dari 0.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want to start from your own graph instead, skip the download and formulate the problem from your NetworkX graph in the same way.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda mahu bermula daripada graf anda sendiri, langkau muat turun dan rumuskan masalah daripada graf NetworkX anda dengan cara yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You use the objective value of the reference solution later to assess the result from SQOA Solver. This tutorial solves this problem on a device with 156 qubits.\n"
msgstr "Anda menggunakan nilai objektif penyelesaian rujukan kemudian untuk menilai hasil daripada SQOA Solver. Tutorial ini menyelesaikan masalah ini pada peranti dengan 156 qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the graph. Later, you also use it to verify that the nodes returned by SQOA Solver form an independent set.\n"
msgstr "Visualkan graf tersebut. Kemudian, anda juga menggunakannya untuk mengesahkan bahawa nod yang dikembalikan oleh SQOA Solver membentuk set tak bersandar.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa/extracted-outputs/7c0c796c-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa/extracted-outputs/7c0c796c-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Formulate the QUBO {#formulate-the-qubo}"
msgstr "Rumuskan QUBO {#formulate-the-qubo}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the binary linear formulation from the Background section as an `OptimizationProblem` with one binary variable per node, an objective that counts the selected nodes, and one constraint per edge. Then convert it with `OptimizationProblemToQubo`.\n"
msgstr "Bina perumusan linear binari daripada bahagian Latar belakang sebagai `OptimizationProblem` dengan satu pemboleh ubah binari bagi setiap nod, objektif yang mengira nod terpilih, dan satu kekangan bagi setiap tepi. Kemudian tukarkannya dengan `OptimizationProblemToQubo`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With a penalty weight of 2, the converter replaces each edge constraint with the penalty term $2 x_v x_w$ and turns the maximization into a minimization, so the converted problem is QOBLIB's binary unconstrained formulation with its sign reversed. The QUBO's variable indices are the graph's node labels. The `IndependentSet` application class in `qiskit_addon_opt_mapper.applications` builds the same constrained model with `IndependentSet(G).to_optimization_problem()`.\n"
msgstr "Dengan berat penalti 2, penukar menggantikan setiap kekangan tepi dengan sebutan penalti $2 x_v x_w$ dan menukar pemaksimuman kepada peminimuman, jadi masalah yang ditukar ialah perumusan binari tanpa kekangan QOBLIB dengan tandanya diterbalikkan. Indeks pemboleh ubah QUBO ialah label nod graf. Kelas aplikasi `IndependentSet` dalam `qiskit_addon_opt_mapper.applications` membina model berkekangan yang sama dengan `IndependentSet(G).to_optimization_problem()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, convert the QUBO to the dictionary format with `to_problem_dict()`. Because the problem is a binary QUBO, the request in Step 2 declares its variable domain as `\"binary\"`. The function performs presolve, quantum mapping, and circuit construction after submission.\n"
msgstr "Akhir sekali, tukarkan QUBO kepada format kamus dengan `to_problem_dict()`. Oleh kerana masalah ini ialah QUBO binari, permintaan dalam Langkah 2 mengisytiharkan domain pemboleh ubahnya sebagai `\"binary\"`. Function melakukan presolve, pemetaan kuantum, dan pembinaan litar selepas penyerahan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize the problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-the-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimumkan masalah untuk pelaksanaan pada perkakasan kuantum {#step-2-optimize-the-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver performs the quantum mapping and hardware preparation inside the function. It first applies presolve to the QUBO, then maps the remaining variables to a relaxed Hamiltonian by using a QRAC-based encoding.\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver melakukan pemetaan kuantum dan penyediaan perkakasan di dalam function. Ia mula-mula menerapkan presolve pada QUBO, kemudian memetakan pemboleh ubah yang tinggal kepada Hamiltonian terlonggar menggunakan pengekodan berasaskan QRAC.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For quantum sampling, it constructs circuits based on the relaxed Hamiltonian and transpiles them for the selected backend. The problem-size and qubit reductions from presolve and encoding depend on the problem, so configure the solver without assuming a fixed reduction factor.\n"
msgstr "Untuk pensampelan kuantum, ia membina litar berdasarkan Hamiltonian terlonggar dan mentranspilnya untuk Backend yang dipilih. Pengurangan saiz masalah dan qubit daripada presolve dan pengekodan bergantung pada masalah, jadi konfigurasikan penyelesai tanpa mengandaikan faktor pengurangan yang tetap.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the solver inputs {#configure-the-solver-inputs}"
msgstr "Konfigurasikan input penyelesai {#configure-the-solver-inputs}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver requires two inputs:\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver memerlukan dua input:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`problem`, the dictionary from Step 1.\n"
msgstr "`problem`, kamus daripada Langkah 1.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`variable_type`, which is `\"binary\"` for this QUBO.\n"
msgstr "`variable_type`, iaitu `\"binary\"` untuk QUBO ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "It also accepts two optional inputs:\n"
msgstr "Ia juga menerima dua input pilihan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`backend_name` selects the QPU. When it is omitted or `None`, the function selects the least busy operational QPU that is accessible to your instance.\n"
msgstr "`backend_name` memilih QPU. Apabila ia ditinggalkan atau `None`, function memilih QPU beroperasi yang paling kurang sibuk dan boleh diakses oleh instans anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`options` is a dictionary that controls the sampling budget (`shots`), the classical seed (`seed`), session usage (`session`), the classical local search (`postprocessing_level`), and job tags (`job_tags`). If you increase `shots`, the sampling statistics can improve.\n"
msgstr "`options` ialah kamus yang mengawal bajet pensampelan (`shots`), benih klasik (`seed`), penggunaan Session (`session`), carian setempat klasik (`postprocessing_level`), dan teg kerja (`job_tags`). Jika anda menambah `shots`, statistik pensampelan boleh bertambah baik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For all inputs, their default values, and validation rules, see the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver).\n"
msgstr "Untuk semua input, nilai lalai dan peraturan pengesahannya, lihat [rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tutorial names the backend explicitly, uses the default values for `shots`, `session`, and `postprocessing_level`, and sets the classical seed. Collect the inputs in a dictionary so that you can pass them to `solver.run()` in Step 3.\n"
msgstr "Tutorial ini menamakan Backend secara eksplisit, menggunakan nilai lalai untuk `shots`, `session`, dan `postprocessing_level`, serta menetapkan benih klasik. Kumpulkan input dalam kamus supaya anda boleh menghantarnya kepada `solver.run()` dalam Langkah 3.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using primitives {#step-3-execute-using-primitives}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Laksanakan menggunakan primitif {#step-3-execute-using-primitives}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submit the job with the SQOA Solver connection created in Step 1. The function runs the IBM Quantum Sampler primitive on the selected backend, collects the measured bitstrings, and continues with the classical diagonalization and post-processing. You interact with a single function job.\n"
msgstr "Serahkan kerja dengan sambungan SQOA Solver yang dicipta dalam Langkah 1. Function menjalankan primitif IBM Quantum Sampler pada Backend yang dipilih, mengumpul rentetan bit yang diukur, dan menyambung dengan pepenjuruan klasik dan pascapemprosesan. Anda berinteraksi dengan satu kerja function sahaja.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To check the status of the workload, see [Check job status](/guides/functions-get-started#check-job-status). Internally, the function proceeds through mapping, hardware optimization, queue waiting, QPU execution, and post-processing phases.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menyemak status beban kerja, lihat [Semak status kerja](/guides/functions-get-started#check-job-status). Secara dalaman, function melalui fasa pemetaan, pengoptimuman perkakasan, menunggu giliran, pelaksanaan QPU, dan pascapemprosesan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`job.result()` blocks until the job completes and returns a dictionary with the solution, its objective value and feasibility, and metadata that holds solver information and resource usage. For the full definition of the inputs and outputs, see the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver).\n"
msgstr "`job.result()` menyekat sehingga kerja selesai dan mengembalikan kamus dengan penyelesaian, nilai objektif dan kebolehlaksanaannya, serta metadata yang memegang maklumat penyelesai dan penggunaan sumber. Untuk takrifan penuh input dan output, lihat [rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process the result and convert it to a classical format {#step-4-post-process-the-result-and-convert-it-to-a-classical-format}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Pascaproses hasil dan tukarkannya kepada format klasik {#step-4-post-process-the-result-and-convert-it-to-a-classical-format}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inspect the complete function output, map the returned assignment back to the graph, verify the selected nodes, and visualize the result.\n"
msgstr "Periksa output function yang lengkap, petakan penetapan yang dikembalikan semula ke graf, sahkan nod terpilih, dan visualkan hasilnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inspect the result {#inspect-the-result}"
msgstr "Periksa hasil {#inspect-the-result}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The result dictionary contains four top-level fields:\n"
msgstr "Kamus hasil mengandungi empat medan peringkat teratas:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`solution` is the complete variable assignment, keyed by `x_i`, where _i_ is the variable index (for example, `x_17`). In this tutorial, the variable index is the node label.\n"
msgstr "`solution` ialah penetapan pemboleh ubah yang lengkap, dikunci dengan `x_i`, dengan _i_ ialah indeks pemboleh ubah (contohnya, `x_17`). Dalam tutorial ini, indeks pemboleh ubah ialah label nod.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`objective_value` is the objective of that assignment evaluated on the submitted dictionary, that is, on the minimization QUBO.\n"
msgstr "`objective_value` ialah objektif penetapan tersebut yang dinilai pada kamus yang diserahkan, iaitu pada QUBO peminimuman.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`feasible` refers only to the variable domain, because the dictionary has no constraints.\n"
msgstr "`feasible` merujuk hanya kepada domain pemboleh ubah, kerana kamus tidak mempunyai kekangan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`metadata` contains `solver_info` and `resource_usage`. `solver_info` records the effective `seed` of the run. If the classical local search ran, `solver_info` also records the rounded assignment from before that refinement in `solution_before_postprocessing`.\n"
msgstr "`metadata` mengandungi `solver_info` dan `resource_usage`. `solver_info` merekodkan `seed` berkesan bagi larian tersebut. Jika carian setempat klasik dijalankan, `solver_info` juga merekodkan penetapan terbundar daripada sebelum penghalusan itu dalam `solution_before_postprocessing`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the solution to the graph {#map-the-solution-to-the-graph}"
msgstr "Petakan penyelesaian ke graf {#map-the-solution-to-the-graph}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collect the returned values in the order of the variable indices, and map them back to the variables of the original problem with `interpret()`. The selected nodes are the variables with the value 1, and `is_feasible()` checks the assignment against the edge constraints of the original problem.\n"
msgstr "Kumpulkan nilai yang dikembalikan mengikut susunan indeks pemboleh ubah, dan petakan semula kepada pemboleh ubah masalah asal dengan `interpret()`. Nod terpilih ialah pemboleh ubah bernilai 1, dan `is_feasible()` menyemak penetapan terhadap kekangan tepi masalah asal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare with the solution before post-processing {#compare-with-the-solution-before-post-processing}"
msgstr "Bandingkan dengan penyelesaian sebelum pascapemprosesan {#compare-with-the-solution-before-post-processing}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because `postprocessing_level` is `1`, `solver_info` also records the rounded assignment from before the classical local search in `solution_before_postprocessing`. It uses the same keys as `solution`.\n"
msgstr "Oleh kerana `postprocessing_level` ialah `1`, `solver_info` juga merekodkan penetapan terbundar daripada sebelum carian setempat klasik dalam `solution_before_postprocessing`. Ia menggunakan kunci yang sama seperti `solution`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Evaluate it on the QUBO to see how much the refinement improved the result. Both values are objectives of the submitted minimization QUBO, so a lower value is better. The field is omitted when the local search does not run, for example, when presolve fixes every variable.\n"
msgstr "Nilaikannya pada QUBO untuk melihat sejauh mana penghalusan memperbaiki hasil. Kedua-dua nilai ialah objektif QUBO peminimuman yang diserahkan, jadi nilai yang lebih rendah adalah lebih baik. Medan ini ditinggalkan apabila carian setempat tidak dijalankan, contohnya, apabila presolve menetapkan setiap pemboleh ubah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify the independence constraint {#verify-the-independence-constraint}"
msgstr "Sahkan kekangan ketakbersandaran {#verify-the-independence-constraint}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because the QUBO represents adjacency through penalty terms rather than explicit constraints, a heuristic result can still select adjacent nodes. Check the returned nodes directly against the graph. For the comparison and visualization in the following sections, copy the returned set and greedily remove one endpoint of each detected conflict.\n"
msgstr "Oleh kerana QUBO mewakili kejiranan melalui sebutan penalti dan bukannya kekangan eksplisit, hasil heuristik masih boleh memilih nod bersebelahan. Semak nod yang dikembalikan terus terhadap graf. Untuk perbandingan dan visualisasi dalam bahagian berikut, salin set yang dikembalikan dan buang secara tamak satu hujung bagi setiap konflik yang dikesan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare with the reference solution {#compare-with-the-reference-solution}"
msgstr "Bandingkan dengan penyelesaian rujukan {#compare-with-the-reference-solution}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In Step 1, you downloaded the objective value of the [QOBLIB reference solution](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/07-independentset/solutions). QOBLIB reference solutions can be optimal or best-known, so compare against the reference objective without assuming that it is always a certified optimum.\n"
msgstr "Dalam Langkah 1, anda memuat turun nilai objektif [penyelesaian rujukan QOBLIB](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/07-independentset/solutions). Penyelesaian rujukan QOBLIB boleh jadi optimum atau terbaik yang diketahui, jadi bandingkan dengan objektif rujukan tanpa mengandaikan bahawa ia sentiasa optimum yang disahkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this maximization problem, a ratio of 1.0 means that the repaired result matches the reference objective.\n"
msgstr "Untuk masalah pemaksimuman ini, nisbah 1.0 bermakna hasil yang dibaiki sepadan dengan objektif rujukan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the result {#visualize-the-result}"
msgstr "Visualkan hasil {#visualize-the-result}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot the graph again with the repaired independent set highlighted. No two highlighted nodes share an edge.\n"
msgstr "Plotkan graf sekali lagi dengan set tak bersandar yang dibaiki diserlahkan. Tiada dua nod yang diserlahkan berkongsi satu tepi.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa/extracted-outputs/41f062f0-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa/extracted-outputs/41f062f0-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Read the resource usage {#read-the-resource-usage}"
msgstr "Baca penggunaan sumber {#read-the-resource-usage}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The result metadata reports `CPU_TIME` for phases other than `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`, when it is available. The `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU` phase can report `QPU_TIME`, the QPU usage returned by Quantum Compute, if the final usage is available for every Quantum Compute job.\n"
msgstr "Metadata hasil melaporkan `CPU_TIME` bagi fasa selain `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`, apabila ia tersedia. Fasa `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU` boleh melaporkan `QPU_TIME`, penggunaan QPU yang dikembalikan oleh Quantum Compute, jika penggunaan akhir tersedia bagi setiap kerja Quantum Compute.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conclusion {#conclusion}"
msgstr "Kesimpulan {#conclusion}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial, you downloaded an MIS instance from QOBLIB, formulated it as a QUBO with `qiskit-addon-opt-mapper`, connected to SQOA Solver, configured and submitted the workload, mapped the returned assignment back to the graph, and checked the selected nodes against the original graph.\n"
msgstr "Dalam tutorial ini, anda memuat turun satu instans MIS daripada QOBLIB, merumuskannya sebagai QUBO dengan `qiskit-addon-opt-mapper`, menyambung kepada SQOA Solver, mengkonfigurasi dan menyerahkan beban kerja, memetakan penetapan yang dikembalikan semula ke graf, dan menyemak nod terpilih terhadap graf asal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You also compared the result with the QOBLIB reference solution, examined the contribution of the classical post-processing, and inspected the resource usage of each execution phase.\n"
msgstr "Anda juga membandingkan hasil dengan penyelesaian rujukan QOBLIB, meneliti sumbangan pascapemprosesan klasik, dan memeriksa penggunaan sumber bagi setiap fasa pelaksanaan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver combines presolve, QRAO with a QRAC-based encoding, sampling-circuit construction, hardware-aware transpilation, sample-based diagonalization, rounding, and classical refinement. This workflow can map more binary variables than a one-variable-per-qubit encoding would allow. The amount of reduction from presolve and encoding depends on the problem structure, and solution quality depends on the samples obtained.\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver menggabungkan presolve, QRAO dengan pengekodan berasaskan QRAC, pembinaan litar pensampelan, transpilasi sedar perkakasan, pepenjuruan berasaskan sampel, pembundaran, dan penghalusan klasik. Aliran kerja ini boleh memetakan lebih banyak pemboleh ubah binari daripada yang dibenarkan oleh pengekodan satu-pemboleh-ubah-setiap-qubit. Jumlah pengurangan daripada presolve dan pengekodan bergantung pada struktur masalah, dan kualiti penyelesaian bergantung pada sampel yang diperoleh.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `shots` and `postprocessing_level` settings control the quantum sampling budget and the classical refinement, respectively, without changing the submission workflow.\n"
msgstr "Tetapan `shots` dan `postprocessing_level` masing-masing mengawal bajet pensampelan kuantum dan penghalusan klasik, tanpa mengubah aliran kerja penyerahan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Appendix: Submit the problem as an OMMX instance {#appendix-submit-the-problem-as-an-ommx-instance}"
msgstr "Lampiran: Serahkan masalah sebagai instans OMMX {#appendix-submit-the-problem-as-an-ommx-instance}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver also accepts an `ommx.v1.Instance` from the [OMMX](https://jij-inc.github.io/ommx/en/introduction.html) SDK. The [OMMX Quantum Benchmarks](https://jij-inc.github.io/OmmxQuantumBenchmarks/) package distributes the QOBLIB problems as OMMX instances together with their reference solutions, so you can load the same QUBO without formulating it yourself.\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver juga menerima `ommx.v1.Instance` daripada SDK [OMMX](https://jij-inc.github.io/ommx/en/introduction.html). Pakej [OMMX Quantum Benchmarks](https://jij-inc.github.io/OmmxQuantumBenchmarks/) mengedarkan masalah QOBLIB sebagai instans OMMX bersama penyelesaian rujukannya, jadi anda boleh memuatkan QUBO yang sama tanpa merumuskannya sendiri.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With an OMMX input, `objective_value` is evaluated in the sense of the instance, and the result also contains the canonical `ommx.v1.Solution`. Install the package, which also installs the OMMX SDK:\n"
msgstr "Dengan input OMMX, `objective_value` dinilai dalam erti instans, dan hasilnya juga mengandungi `ommx.v1.Solution` kanonik. Pasang pakej tersebut, yang turut memasang SDK OMMX:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Load the `binary_unconstrained` model of the same instance. The dataset loader prints progress messages, so the code captures them to keep the output compact.\n"
msgstr "Muatkan model `binary_unconstrained` bagi instans yang sama. Pemuat set data mencetak mesej kemajuan, jadi kod menangkapnya untuk memastikan output padat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver receives an OMMX instance as a standard padded Base64 string and returns the canonical solution in the same format. Define two helper functions for this conversion:\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver menerima instans OMMX sebagai rentetan Base64 berlapik piawai dan mengembalikan penyelesaian kanonik dalam format yang sama. Tentukan dua fungsi pembantu untuk penukaran ini:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`to_problem_payload()` serializes an `ommx.v1.Instance` into the string that you pass as `problem`.\n"
msgstr "`to_problem_payload()` menyirikan `ommx.v1.Instance` menjadi rentetan yang anda hantar sebagai `problem`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`to_ommx_solution()` decodes the canonical `ommx.v1.Solution` from the result.\n"
msgstr "`to_ommx_solution()` menyahkod `ommx.v1.Solution` kanonik daripada hasil.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submit the instance with the same inputs as before, replacing only `problem`. Then decode the canonical solution and read the selected nodes by variable name.\n"
msgstr "Hantar instance dengan input yang sama seperti sebelum ini, dengan hanya menggantikan `problem`. Kemudian nyahkod penyelesaian kanonik dan baca nod yang dipilih mengikut nama pemboleh ubah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"* Apply the workflow to your own QUBO problems. Build an `OptimizationProblem` as shown in the [SQOA Solver guide](/guides/jij-sqoa-solver). The steps for conversion and submission remain the same, but adapt the validation to the structure of your problem.\n"
"* Submit the problem as an OMMX instance, as shown in the [appendix](#appendix-submit-the-problem-as-an-ommx-instance). See the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver) for the accepted problem formats and the returned fields.\n"
"* Explore other independent-set instances in the [QOBLIB repository](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/07-independentset) or through [OMMX Quantum Benchmarks](https://jij-inc.github.io/OmmxQuantumBenchmarks/).\n"
"* Learn more about modeling with [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/) or [JijModeling](https://jij-inc-jijmodeling-tutorials-en.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/introduction.html) and exchanging problems with [OMMX](https://ommx-en-book.readthedocs.io/en/latest/).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"* Gunakan aliran kerja ini pada masalah QUBO anda sendiri. Bina `OptimizationProblem` seperti yang ditunjukkan dalam [panduan SQOA Solver](/guides/jij-sqoa-solver). Langkah penukaran dan penghantaran kekal sama, tetapi sesuaikan pengesahan dengan struktur masalah anda.\n"
"* Hantar masalah sebagai instance OMMX, seperti yang ditunjukkan dalam [lampiran](#appendix-submit-the-problem-as-an-ommx-instance). Lihat [rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver) untuk format masalah yang diterima dan medan yang dikembalikan.\n"
"* Terokai instance independent-set lain dalam [repositori QOBLIB](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/07-independentset) atau melalui [OMMX Quantum Benchmarks](https://jij-inc.github.io/OmmxQuantumBenchmarks/).\n"
"* Ketahui lebih lanjut tentang pemodelan dengan [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-opt-mapper/) atau [JijModeling](https://jij-inc-jijmodeling-tutorials-en.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/introduction.html) dan pertukaran masalah dengan [OMMX](https://ommx-en-book.readthedocs.io/en/latest/).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

